1. PROJECT TITLE AND OVERALL OBJECTIVE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Title: Compiler for Processing in Memory (PIM): Design and Simulation
Objective: To build an educational compiler and simulation platform that accepts
C source programs, transforms them into an intermediate representation, identifies
operations eligible for in-memory acceleration (Processing in Memory), offloads them
to simulated PIM hardware instructions, and compares simulated CPU execution against
PIM execution to demonstrate data-movement reduction and execution speedups.


